{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18294","headline":"送郑十校理得洛字 · 韩愈","name":"送郑十校理得洛字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相公倦台鼎，分正新邑洛。\n才子富文华，校讐天禄阁。\n寿觞佳节过，归骑春衫薄。\n鸟哢正交加，杨花共纷泊。\n亲交谁不羡，去去翔寥廓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18294.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18294","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}